(31, 1, 'Richard Herring', 'Richard', 0, NULL, 0, NULL, 1, 0, '|actor|comedian|media producer|podcaster|screenwriter|Twitch streamer|', 'Richard is an actor, comedian and podcaster who has appeared as a contestant on Taskmaster.', 'In his 2020 <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/taskmaster/comments/kf7e0h/i_am_richard_herring_from_taskmaster_season_10_ama/\">Reddit AMA</a>, Richard revealed that he had been somehow involved in one of the live <a href=\"https://getoffmyweb.site/taskmastermaster/show.php?show=10\">Taskmaster Edinburgh</a> shows which happened before the show was commissioned. He noted that <a href=\"https://getoffmyweb.site/taskmastermaster/person.php?person=34\">Tim Key</a> had cracked one of his ribs at the start of the show. No further details about the nature of his involvement were revealed.', NULL, 'https://www.imdb.com/name/nm0380672/', 'https://www.instagram.com/rkherring1967/', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.twitch.tv/rkherring', 'http://www.richardherring.com/', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Richard_Herring', NULL, '0031_richard_herring.png', '0031_richard_herring_metatag.jpg', '0031_richard_herring_pinky.png', '0031_richard_herring_search.jpg', '0031_richard_herring_thumb.png', NULL),
