(143, 1, 'Christian Fuhlendorff', 'Christian', 0, NULL, 0, NULL, 1, 0, '|comedian|presenter|actor|screenwriter|', 'Christian is a comedian, presenter and actor who has appeared as a contestant on Stormester.', NULL, 'Christian arrived on location eating something different at the beginning of each of his tasks. The list of things he appears to have eaten include: a sausage, an ice lolly, a chilli pepper, a large chocolate coin, pre-sliced cheese, some kind of cracker or biscuit, a slice of pizza, an apple, a cucumber, a raw onion, a wheel of camembert cheese, a large spring onion, or small leek, a wedge of lemon, the mystery contents of an unlabelled tin can, a large bottle of coke, a lollipop, part of a paper cup. He continued this bit into the Champion of Champions special (details to be added later!).', 'https://www.imdb.com/name/nm1833068/', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://christianfuhlendorff.dk/', 'https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Christian_Fuhlendorff', 'https://www.youtube.com/user/Fuhlendorffdk/', '0143_christian_fuhlendorff.png', '0143_christian_fuhlendorff_metatag.jpg', '0143_christian_fuhlendorff_pinky.png', '0143_christian_fuhlendorff_search.jpg', '0143_christian_fuhlendorff_thumb.png', NULL),
