(278, 1, 'Linda P', 'Linda', 0, NULL, 0, NULL, 1, 0, '|comedian|actor|screenwriter|', 'Linda is a comedian and actor who has appeared as a contestant on Stormester.', NULL, 'At the start of each pre-filmed task (and a couple of times, later on within the tasks, where filming was put on hold to source supplies), Linda greeted Mark with a different variation of his last name. Her nicknames for him, across the season, included: Mark le Fedtberg [Fatberg]; Mark le Fitfuck; Mark le Færing [Faroese]; Mark le Færten-af-en-svensker [Scent-of-a-Swede]; Mark le Fêstabe [Party-monkey]; Mark le Fêtich [Fetish]; Mark le Fægtekamp [Fencing-match]; Mark le Færdselstavle [Road-sign]; Mark le Fender; Mark le Fêstivaltoilet [Festival-toilet]; Mark le Fênnikelfrø [Fennel-seeds]; Mark le Feng-shui; Mark le Fersken med flødeskum fra 80\'erne; når man ikke har råd til andet [Peaches-with-whipped-cream-from-the-80s-when-you-can\'t-afford-anything-else]; Mark le Fêinschmecker [Connoisseur]; Mark le Fængselsstraf for at være så tåbelig [Jail-sentence-for-being-so-foolish]; Mark le Femdørsberlingo [Five-door-Berlingo; a vehicle model manufactured by Citroën]; Mark le Finderup Lade [Finderup-barn; location of the murder of the Danish king Erik Klipping]; Mark le Fæces [Faeces]; Mark le Feltration [Field-ration]; Mark le Færdigpakket [Pre-packed]; Mark le Femårig [Five-year-old]; Mark le Fêrtilitetsklinik [Fertility-clinic]; Mark le Femølejren [Femø-camp; a women\'s camp on Femø island]; Mark le Fællesnævner [Common-denominator]; Mark le Fejebakke [Dustpan]; Mark le Fernando; Mark le Fehår [Fairy-hair]; Mark le Færgebillet [Ferry-ticket]; Mark le Fever; Mark le Feminin [Feminine]; Mark le Ferskvand frem for saltvand [Freshwater-rather-than-saltwater]; Mark le Færdigret [Ready-meal]; and Mark le Femkant [Pentagon]. She also continued this, in a manner, in the One More Chance special (details to be added later!).', 'https://www.imdb.com/name/nm2622353/', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://linda-p.dk/', 'https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Linda_P', NULL, '0278_linda_pedersen.png', '0278_linda_pedersen_metatag.jpg', '0278_linda_pedersen_pinky.png', '0278_linda_pedersen_search.jpg', '0278_linda_pedersen_thumb.png', NULL),
